# 基础词 Unit06
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit06核心词汇

{{bedroom}}{/ˈbedruːm/}{{n. 卧室}}{{The bedroom has a large window overlooking the garden.}}
{{beef}}{/biːf/}{{n. 牛肉}}{{We had roast beef for dinner last night.}}
{{beer}}{/bɪər/}{{n. 啤酒}}{{He ordered a glass of cold beer at the pub.}}
{{before}}{/bɪˈfɔːr/}{{prep./conj. 在…之前}}{{Please wash your hands before eating.}}
{{beg}}{/beɡ/}{{v. 请求；乞求}}{{The child begged his mother for a new toy.}}
{{begin}}{/bɪˈɡɪn/}{{v. 开始}}{{The concert will begin at 8 p.m.}}
{{behalf}}{/bɪˈhɑːf/}{{n. 代表；利益}}{{He spoke on behalf of the entire team.}}
{{behave}}{/bɪˈheɪv/}{{v. 表现；举止}}{{The children behaved well during the ceremony.}}
{{behavior}}{/bɪˈheɪvjər/}{{n. 行为；举止}}{{His behavior at the party was unacceptable.}}
{{behind}}{/bɪˈhaɪnd/}{{prep. 在…后面；adv. 在后面}}{{The cat hid behind the sofa.}}
{{belief}}{/bɪˈliːf/}{{n. 信念；信仰}}{{She has a strong belief in the power of education.}}
{{believe}}{/bɪˈliːv/}{{v. 相信；认为}}{{I believe that hard work leads to success.}}
{{bell}}{/bel/}{{n. 铃；钟}}{{The school bell rings at 8 o'clock every morning.}}
{{belong}}{/bɪˈlɒŋ/}{{v. 属于}}{{This book belongs to the library.}}
{{beloved}}{/bɪˈlʌvɪd/}{{adj. 心爱的；n. 心爱的人}}{{He dedicated the book to his beloved wife.}}
{{below}}{/bɪˈləʊ/}{{prep. 在…下面；adv. 在下面}}{{The temperature dropped below zero last night.}}
{{belt}}{/belt/}{{n. 腰带；地带}}{{He wore a black leather belt with his jeans.}}
{{bench}}{/bentʃ/}{{n. 长凳；工作台}}{{They sat on a bench in the park and watched the sunset.}}
{{bend}}{/bend/}{{v. 弯曲；n. 弯道}}{{Be careful when you bend down to pick up the box.}}
{{beneath}}{/bɪˈniːθ/}{{prep. 在…下方}}{{The treasure was buried beneath the old tree.}}
{{benefit}}{/ˈbenɪfɪt/}{{n. 利益；好处；v. 受益}}{{Exercise has many health benefits.}}
{{beside}}{/bɪˈsaɪd/}{{prep. 在…旁边}}{{She sat beside me during the movie.}}
{{besides}}{/bɪˈsaɪz/}{{prep. 除…之外；adv. 而且}}{{Besides English, she also speaks French and German.}}
{{best}}{/best/}{{adj. 最好的；adv. 最好地}}{{This is the best restaurant in town.}}
{{better}}{/ˈbetər/}{{adj. 更好的；adv. 更好地}}{{Practice makes you better at any skill.}}
{{between}}{/bɪˈtwiːn/}{{prep. 在…之间}}{{The distance between the two cities is 200 miles.}}
{{beyond}}{/bɪˈjɒnd/}{{prep. 超越；在…的另一边}}{{The view beyond the mountains was breathtaking.}}
{{bicycle}}{/ˈbaɪsɪkl/}{{n. 自行车}}{{He rides his bicycle to work every day.}}
{{bid}}{/bɪd/}{{v./n. 出价；投标}}{{The company made a bid for the construction project.}}
{{billion}}{/ˈbɪljən/}{{n. 十亿}}{{The company is worth several billion dollars.}}
{{bind}}{/baɪnd/}{{v. 捆绑；约束}}{{The contract binds both parties to the agreement.}}
{{biology}}{/baɪˈɒlədʒi/}{{n. 生物学}}{{She is majoring in biology at university.}}
{{birth}}{/bɜːrθ/}{{n. 出生；起源}}{{The birth of their first child changed their lives.}}
{{bit}}{/bɪt/}{{n. 一点儿；小块}}{{Could you wait a bit longer, please?}}
{{bite}}{/baɪt/}{{v. 咬；n. 一口}}{{Be careful, that dog might bite.}}
{{bitter}}{/ˈbɪtər/}{{adj. 苦的；痛苦的}}{{The medicine has a very bitter taste.}}
{{blame}}{/bleɪm/}{{v. 责备；归咎于；n. 责任}}{{Don't blame others for your own mistakes.}}
{{blank}}{/blæŋk/}{{adj. 空白的；茫然的}}{{Please fill in the blank spaces on the form.}}
{{blanket}}{/ˈblæŋkɪt/}{{n. 毯子；毛毯}}{{She wrapped herself in a warm blanket.}}
{{bleed}}{/bliːd/}{{v. 流血}}{{The wound continued to bleed for several minutes.}}
